window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Kane's quest ends here.</b></p> <p>From the beginning, his only desire was to become a wolf once again. But Kane and Emelda know they must take down Covenant first, and this will be their most dangerous fight yet.</p> <p>Can this ex-criminal be his salvation and get him home to his pack? Or will the end of this adventure mean an end for them both?</p>"; 
